/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 104 0 R
/E (Life Helpers Initiative, a non-government organization has a programmatic mandate towards children. This is enshrined in our programs which involve vulnerable children and the girl child as well as child protection. The core of this policy is child safeguarding. And according to the Nigerian constitution which Life Helpers shall abide by, a child is defined as anyone under 18 years of age, irrespective of creed, tribe or religion.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [5]
>>
